February 28 - Update (v0.12.4)

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

Changes

 Connected loading screens to biomes of the run started or ended;
 Now Elites and Bosses produce higher value souls, that grants respectively 3 and 5 SP;
 Added Elder Tree node to the legend in map;
 Battle dashboard now displays also max health;
 Removed selection during enemy turns;
 Minor graphic changes;


BugFix

 Fixed bug that enabled selector at the start of a battle;
 Fixed bug that show dashboard of a Soulkin hovered at the end of the previous battle;
 Fixed bug that didn't show correctly tooltip of enemy skills;
 Fixed bug that gave multiple times the same blessings during a run;
 Fixed bug that sometimes didn't let you collect soul;
 Fixed bug that didn't let some skills work on Nadia or Bosses;
 Fixed bug that didn't let enemy end their turn if one of their Soulkin is defeated in that turn;
 Fixed bug that didn't correctly heal Soulkin between acts;
 Fixed bug that sometimes didn't correctly save Soulkin upgrades;


Known Bugs

 Sometimes after leaving a shop in which the player purchase an item/service it's impossible to select the next node in map.

