October 14 - Update (v0.9.9)

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

New features

 Added german localization;


Balancing

 Update Collection rewards and steps to achieve that reward;
 Reduced number of Event and Bonus nodes that can appear in a run;
 Increased number of normal battle nodes that can appear in a run;
 Energy rewarded at the end of a normal battle: 0 -> 2;
 "Bubble" skill: -> An Ally within range 2 gains a shield, lasting until your next turn, that negates the first damage taken, then it expires;
 Catemori Atk: 3 -> 2;
 Kintsu skill: Blaze -> Fiery;
 Elite Akakuma skill: Counter -> Retaliate;
 Changed starting artifact list;


Changes
Options

 Minor graphic changes;

Map

 Minor graphic changes;
 Updated map generation algorithm;

Battle

 Minor graphic changes;
 Skill buttons now are fully clickable;
 Changed Armor vfx;


Bug Fixes

 Fixed bug that didn't let ai end the turn;
 Fixed bug that didn't update missing hearts;
 Fixed bug that brought the rewards from previous run on to the next one.



Known Bugs and WIP

Working on

 Adding Gamepad support;
 Localizing the game in additional languages;
 Update Tutorial;

