September 18 - Update (v0.9.8)

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

New features

 Introduced the ability to save during a run. It is automatically done after completing a node or pressing "SaveAndQuit" button in Options: It is possible to continue the run pressing play and clicking on "Continue" button that appear on Region Selection screen;
 Added a new Loading screen when moving from Home to Map and vice versa;
 Added transition effect when starting a battle;


Changes
Region selection

 Minor graphic changes; 

Options

 Minor graphic changes;
 Added "SaveAndQuit" button;

Map

 Minor graphic changes;
 Reduced time from when pressing the Surrender button in map to the actual end run screen;

Battle

 Minor graphic changes


Bug Fixes

 Fixed bug that didn't correctly show chest sprites in battle;
 Fixed bug that show action points of the last clicked soulkin when showing information about a soulkin not in battlefield;
 Fixed bug that show a wrong tooltip on crystals that appear in artifact selection after a battle;
 Fixed bug that showed "Saved" on a Soul if the creature died after attacking an enemy creature due to an enemy effect;
 Fixed bug that didn't correctly mark the checkbox on a regional objective;
 Fixed bug that didn't show Elite Sandagha and Elite Akakuma in Collection;



Known Bugs and WIP

Known Bugs

 Some texts are out of bounds of their containing box;
 Sometimes enemy doesn't end turn;

Working on

 Adding Gamepad support;
 Localizing the game in additional languages;

