July 27 - Update (v0.9.2)

Hey everyone, we have some updates to share with you all.

If following the reward changing, you obtained a reward from the ones changed and the game do not recognise this, try to start and finish a run, reach the Home and after that restart the game. 
Balancing

 Kurgalan Atk: 3 -> 2;
 Kabutoroi Hp: 6 -> 5;
 Umimi Atk: 1 -> 2, Hp: 6 -> 4;
 Biriwack Hp: 7 -> 6;
 Whixy first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
 Maytis first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
 Spitfin first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
 Biriwack first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 1;
 Nealid first Collection reward requirement: 5 -> 3;
 Starting Nadia soul points: 10 -> 8;
 Elite Units Defeat Crystal reward: 10 -> 5;
 Boss defeat Crystal Reward: 50 -> 25;
 Boss defeat Energy Reward: 10 -> 15;

Map

 Shown Collection Progress of each discovered Soulkin on Battle Node Preview;
 Shown Soulkin not yet encountered with a "?" on Battle Node Preview;

Run

 When you end a run, there is a new popup showing the affinity progress reached during the run;
 When you end a run, you can choose to go to Collection or simply return to Home;
 Improved end run recap flow;

Collection

 Clicking on a Soulkin let you see the Soulkin information, without the need of hovering on it;
 Revised and updated reward texts;
 Added Zapien second Collection reward;
 Added Luona second Collection reward;
 Added Kintsu second Collection reward;
 Added Aknat second Collection reward;

Home

 Revised after "Play" button popup to better convey the objective of the game;

Bug Fixes

 Fixed bug that didn't let players use Nadia unlocked upgraded skill , after launching the game;
 Fixed bug that didn't show the change of owner of a Soulkin after Kurgalan used "Mind Control" skill;
 Fixed text during Region Selection that overlapped name of the Boss with its checkbox;
 Fixed bug that didn't show Carawurm second Collection reward text;

Known Bugs

 "Null" skill doesn't remove "Armored";
 "Cleanse" and "Revitalize" skills don't remove "Restrained" status;
 "Aggressive" use one action movement;
 Affinity increase notification remains on battle after an Elite or Boss Battle;

